From: Hai Pham <hai.pham.ud@renesas.com>
Date: Mon, 26 May 2025 20:43:14 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 38/52] arm64: dts: renesas: ironhide: Enable Multi-Protocol
 PHY

Enable support for the Multi-Protocol PHY controller

Signed-off-by: Hai Pham <hai.pham.ud@renesas.com>
---
 arch/arm/dts/r8a78000-ironhide.dts | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm/dts/r8a78000-ironhide.dts b/arch/arm/dts/r8a78000-ironhide.dts
index f17a93085cf..17f38f255fb 100644
--- a/arch/arm/dts/r8a78000-ironhide.dts
+++ b/arch/arm/dts/r8a78000-ironhide.dts
@@ -114,6 +114,10 @@
 	clock-frequency = <400000>;
 };
 
+&mp_phy {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 &pfc {
 	pinctrl-0 = <&scif_clk_pins>;
 	pinctrl-names = "default";
-- 
